- **Reading Input Text**: We prompt the user to enter the text they wish to search through. Using `io::stdin().lock().read_line(&mut buffer)` allows us to safely read a single line of input from standard input.

- **Substring Matching**: With `buffer.contains(search_term)`, we check if the entered text includes the specified substring. Depending on the result, we print either "Match found!" or "No match."

